  extension new <id> --template T [--name N]   Scaffold from a template
  extension install <path>          Install an extension dir
  extension remove <id>             Uninstall an extension
  extension stop <ext:N>            Stop a running extension backend
  extension reload                  Re-scan the extensions dir

I/O:
  send [--surface S] "text"         Send text to terminal.
                                    Escapes: \\n and \\r both send carriage
                                    return (the terminal expects \\r for Enter,
                                    not \\n). \\t = tab, \\x1b = ESC, \\\\ = literal \\.
  send-key [--surface S] <key>      Send key (enter|tab|escape|...)
  read-screen [--surface S] [--lines N]  Read terminal content
  screenshot [target] [--output PATH]
